nd/                     # Node.js/Express API\n│  ├─ src/                     # Application source\n│  │  ├─ middleware/           # Auth, RBAC, error handling, tenant isolation\n│  │  ├─ controllers/          # Route handlers\n│  │  ├─ routes/               # Express routers (auth, tenants, users, projects, tasks)\n│  │  ├─ utils/                # Audit logger\n│  │  └─ app.js                # Express app bootstrap\n│  ├─ migrations/              # SQL migration files\n│  ├─ seeds/                   # Seed data script\n│  ├─ Dockerfile               # Multi‑stage build\n│  ├─ docker-entrypoint.sh     # Runs migrations, seeds, then starts server\n│  └─ package.json\n├─ frontend/                    # React UI (Vite)\n│  ├─ src/\n│  │  ├─ components/           # Shared UI components (placeholder)\n│  │  ├─ pages/                # Page components (Register, Login, Dashboard, …)\n│  │  ├─ api/                  # Centralised API service (axios placeholder)\n│  │  └─ App.jsx                # Root component (placeholder)\n│  ├─ Dockerfile\n│  ├─ vite.config.js\n│  └─ package.json\n├─ docker-compose.yml           # Orchestrates DB, backend, frontend\n├─ .env.example                 # Environment variable template\n├─ docs/\n│  ├─ research.md\n│  ├─ PRD.md\n│  ├─ architecture.md\n│  ├─ technical-spec.md\n│  └─ API.md\n└─ submission.json              # Test credentials for automated evaluation\n```\n\n## Getting Started (Local Development)\n\n1. **Clone the repository**\n   ```bash\n   git clone <repo-url>\n   cd <repo-dir>\n   ```\n2. **Create an `.env` file** (copy from `.env.example`) and adjust values if needed.\n3. **Run Docker Compose**\n   ```bash\n   docker-compose up -d\n   ```\n   This will:\n   - Start PostgreSQL on port **5432** (service name `database`).\n   - Build and start the backend on port **5000** (service name `backend`).\n   - Build and start the React frontend on port **3000** (service name `frontend`).\n4. **Verify health**\n   ```bash\n   curl http://